{"id":"karre","lemma":"Karre","pos":"noun","rank":3843,"glosses":["cart, barrow","car, automobile"],"ipa":"/ˈkaʁə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/52/De-Karre.ogg/De-Karre.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Karre","plural":"Karren"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Karren stand im Schuppen.","en":"The cart was in the shed.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"shed"}]},{"text":"Tom stieg in seine Karre.","en":"Tom got into the car.","words":[null,{"g":"to ascend","l":"steigen"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Man soll den Karren nicht vor den Esel spannen.","en":"Don't put the cart before the horse.","words":[{"g":"one"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"ass, donkey"},{"g":"to stretch"}]},{"text":"Ich werde mich eine Zeitlang mit der alten Karre begnügen müssen.","en":"I'll have to make do with the old car for a while.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"while"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"old","l":"alt"},null,{"g":"to be content or…"},{"g":"to have to"}]},{"text":"Tom hat für die alte Karre viel zuviel bezahlt.","en":"Tom paid way too much for that old car.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"},null,{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"excess"},{"g":"to pay","l":"bezahlen"}]}]}